Package: cellboard
Title: Interactive Single-Cell RNA-seq Quality Control Dashboard
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Amit", "Shenoy", email = "shenoy.am@husky.neu.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny dashboard for interactive quality control (QC) of
    single-cell RNA-seq data, aimed at bench scientists who want to QC
    their data without writing code. Load 10x Genomics, SingleCellExperiment,
    or Seurat input; compute per-cell QC metrics (mitochondrial percentage,
    genes and UMIs detected, and 'scDblFinder' doublet scores); explore the
    distributions with interactive plots; set filtering thresholds with live
    retained-versus-discarded feedback; and export a filtered
    SingleCellExperiment together with an auto-generated, reproducible
    R Markdown report. Designed for one-click deployment to Posit Connect.
